=20

Dear Brent,

=20

Can you please confirm if in the matter of the draft judgement you are assi=
sting the court or representing my children and me, our best interests, our =
safety, and protecting us from threats, danger, and direct harm.=20

=20

I need a clear and unambiguous answer.

=20

With kind wishes,

Nadia

=20

=20

=20

=20

From: Brent Molyneux KC <BMolyneux@29br.co.uk>
Date: Friday, April 12, 2024 at 5:54=E2=80=AFPM
To: "Selby-King, Karen" <Karen.Selby-King@justice.gov.uk>
Cc: Alexis Campbell KC <ACampbellKC@29br.co.uk>, Sassa-Ann Amaouche <samaou=
che@29br.co.uk>, AFP BLOOM <Zoe.Bloom@afpbloom.com>, Nadia <nadia@rosekross.=
com>
Subject: Z v Z

=20

=20

Dear Karen

=20

I attach a list of what I have identified as corrections / errors.

=20

I do so, mindful as I am of my obligation to try and help the Court and his=
 Lordship, and because I received your email inviting me to assist.

=20

I must however add that I am not instructed by Mrs. Zahmoul and she will al=
most certainly have her own list of corrections / errors /  material omissio=
ns that she will wish to provide to you.  Please do not treat the attached d=
ocument as a substitution or replacement for anything which Mrs. Zahmoul, ac=
ting in person, may wish the judge to consider. That is not the purpose or i=
ntent of the document which I am attaching. It is simply an attempt to help.=
=20

=20

With best wishes

=20

Brent Molyneux


Brent Molyneux KC - Barrister=20

Chambers of Alexis Campbell KC and Nicholas Allen KC=20

A 29 Bedford Row, London WC1R 4HE DX LDE 1044=20
T 020 7404 1044 E bmolyneux@29br.co.uk=20

This e-mail is intended for the use of the addressee only and may contain i=
nformation that is confidential, privileged and/or exempt from disclosure. I=
f you are not the intended recipient you must not read, copy, distribute or =
disseminate this communication or any attachments to anyone other than the a=
ddressee or use the information it contains or otherwise take any action in =
reliance on it. If you receive this communication in error, please inform me=
 or a member of staff at 29BR by telephone immediately and permanently delet=
e it from your computer.=20

29BR is committed to safeguarding your privacy. 29BR collects, uses and is =
